---
description: Documentation Standards
globs: ["**/docs/*.md"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing detection documentation:

1. File Location:
- Place in detections/docs/{detection_name}.md
- Use same name as detection file

2. Documentation Structure:
```markdown
## Overview

Detect when [specific event occurs]. [Impact description]. [Purpose/benefit].

**References**:
- [Title](url)
```

3. Content Requirements:
- Overview should be 2-3 sentences
- First sentence describes what is being detected
- Second sentence describes impact
- Third sentence describes purpose/benefit
- Include relevant AWS documentation links
- Include related AWS CLI command references
- Use proper markdown formatting 
